      "id": 12863,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "1.0.2",
      "description": "<p>This update brings even more customization (all optional!), for some who aim to make their game harder, or poke around!</p>\n<h3>Introducing:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Temporary blindness from headshots</li>\n<li>Temporary blindness from grenade explosions</li>\n<li>Tinnitus mitigation, if enabled (like a global switch)</li>\n<li>Option to use more headshot sounds, or just one!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Along that I have fixed a few bugs related to headshot proc when you hit barbed wire with your head. Thank you all!</p>\n<h2>New Previews</h2>\n<h3>Headshot Blindness</h3>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"Q9j5zl2wxjE\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Q9j5zl2wxjE?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Q9j5zl2wxjE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<h3>Grenade Blindness</h3>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"UnDFBs8KD_s\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/UnDFBs8KD_s?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UnDFBs8KD_s/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n",
